sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CN as Card Network<br/>(PER-009)
    participant SVC011 as SVC-011<br/>Card Processing
    participant BUS as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant SVC013 as SVC-013<br/>Fraud Detection
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053<br/>Notification Service
    participant SVC103 as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging
    participant FA as Fraud Analyst<br/>(PER-054)

    Note over CN,SVC011: Transaction 1 — First auth (approved — country A)
    CN->>SVC011: ISO 8583 Auth Request #1 (card, country A)
    SVC011-->>CN: Response: APPROVED (00)
    SVC011->>BUS: EVT-065 CardAuthorisationCompleted #1 (channel_country_code = GB)
    BUS->>SVC013: EVT-065 #1 → velocity counter updated

    Note over CN,SVC011: Transaction 2 — Second auth 3 minutes later (approved — country B)
    CN->>SVC011: ISO 8583 Auth Request #2 (same card, country B = DE)
    SVC011-->>CN: Response: APPROVED (00)
    SVC011->>BUS: EVT-065 CardAuthorisationCompleted #2 (channel_country_code = DE)
    BUS->>SVC013: EVT-065 #2 → Pattern analysis triggered

    Note over SVC013: Geographic impossibility detected:<br/>Same card used GB and DE within 3 minutes<br/>(physical travel impossible)
    SVC013->>SVC013: Evaluate cross-transaction pattern<br/>pattern_type = geographic_impossibility<br/>risk_score = 0.97<br/>recommended_action = block_card

    SVC013->>BUS: EVT-068 SuspiciousCardActivityDetected<br/>(card_number_token, pattern_type=geographic_impossibility,<br/>recommended_action=block_card, affected_transactions=[auth_id_1, auth_id_2])
    BUS->>SVC103: EVT-068 (WORM audit — risk_score redacted in SVC-103 entry)

    Note over BUS,SVC011: SVC-011 consumes EVT-068 — card block
    BUS->>SVC011: EVT-068 (recommended_action = block_card)
    SVC011->>SVC011: Update local card status cache:<br/>card_number_token → status = suspended_fraud_investigation

    Note over BUS,FA: Fraud Analyst notified
    BUS->>FA: EVT-068 → Fraud case created in INTL-003<br/>(full risk_score + pattern_type visible to PER-054)

    Note over BUS,SVC053: Customer notified (generic — no fraud pattern disclosed)
    BUS->>SVC053: EVT-068 (notify customer)
    SVC053->>SVC053: Dispatch push notification (CH-002):<br/>"Unusual activity detected. Card temporarily blocked.<br/>Call fraud line if you need assistance."

    Note over CN,SVC011: Transaction 3 — attempted after card block
    CN->>SVC011: ISO 8583 Auth Request #3 (same card)
    SVC011->>SVC011: Check card status cache → suspended_fraud_investigation
    SVC011-->>CN: Response: DECLINED (D05 — Do Not Honour)
    SVC011->>BUS: EVT-066 CardAuthorisationDeclined<br/>(scheme_response_code = D05, NO decline_reason in payload)

    Note over FA: PER-054 reviews case in INTL-003
    FA->>FA: Reviews transaction timeline, MCC patterns,<br/>geographic impossibility. Confirms genuine compromise.
    FA->>SVC011: PATCH /card-status/{card_number_token}<br/>action = maintain_block (card remains suspended)
    FA->>SVC011: Initiate card replacement workflow
